<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#06080C">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light">

<!-- Primary SEO -->
<title>The Platform — VitaCrypt's Four Pillars (Unified · Cited · Encrypted · Personalized)</title>
<meta name="description" content="How VitaCrypt works: six biological streams unified, every recommendation cited to live science, computed under FHE so the server never sees plaintext, and personalized to your genes and environment.">
<meta name="keywords" content="VitaCrypt platform, FHE, fully homomorphic encryption, data fabric, live science, PubMed, Cochrane, encrypted health, gene environment, MTHFR, APOE, Zama Concrete ML">
<meta name="author" content="VitaCrypt">
<meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1">
<meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://vitacrypt.xyz/platform.html">

